@baseUrl = http://localhost:5084

### 1. Create Category (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Electronic devices and gadgets"
}

### 2. Get All Categories (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### 3. Get Category by Id (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1

### 4. Update Category (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics Updated",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### 5. Delete Category (DELETE) - only succeeds if it has no products
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1

### --- PRODUCTS ---

### 6. Create Product (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "sku": "WM-101",
  "price": 25.50,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 7. Get All Products (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 8. Get Products Filtered by Category (GET with query param)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?categoryId=1

### 9. Get Product by Id (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### 10. Update Product Stock - Add (+5) (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delta": 5
}

### 11. Update Product Stock - Remove (-3) (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delta": -3
}

### 12. Update Product Stock - Exceeding stock (should return 409 Conflict)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delta": -999
}
